WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:11.900
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.400
Open the task — this one has no date yet

3
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.000
Tap Edit

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.700
Pull the form up to its dates

5
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.300
Turn on Due date

6
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.600
Pick the day in the calendar — or tap here to type it

7
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.800
Type the day the way you'd say it

8
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.900
The date is read as you type

9
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.400
Return sets it

10
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.900
Due time, if the hour matters

11
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:53.500
Start date: the day you plan to begin

12
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.000
Save

13
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.200
It starts today, so it moves to the top of the list

14
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:10.700
The task carries its day and time
